==History== 
*The Goblin Queen Tower was added to the game on 17/6/2024, in the [[Version History#Goblin World Update (17/6/2024)|Goblin World Update]].
*On 30/7/2024, the [[Version History#Goblin Queen's Journey Changes Update (30/7/2024)|Goblin Queen's Journey Changes Update]] changed the Goblin Queen Tower’s level to depend on the [[King's Tower]]'s evel instead of the [[Baby Goblins]]' level.
*On 30/10/2024, the [[Version History#Removal of Goblin Queen's Journey Update (30/10/2024)|Removal of Goblin Queen's Journey Update]] removed the Goblin Queen Tower alongside [[Goblin Queen's Journey]].

