==Trivia==
*The Goblin Queen Tower is the first and currently only [[King's Tower|King Tower]] replacement.
*The Goblin Queen's ability is actually given to her by the [[Baby Goblins]] [[:Category:Tower Troop Cards|tower troop]] and not herself, as she comes automatically selected with the tower troop.
*According to a [[Loading Screen Hints|Loading Screen Hint]], Goblin Queen is a great pastry chef, but being a queen gets more money.
*The Goblin Queen is the subject of 4 [[Emotes]].

